    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "cause": "Defective throttle sensor (fuel dial)",
      "procedure": "1. Starting switch: OFF 2. Disconnect the connector P20. Turn the starting switch to the ON position. If this failure code is cleared, the throttle sensor is defective. Other failure codes are shown, too. This occurs because the connector is disconnected. Ignore failure codes other than this failure code [CA2185].",
      "branches": {},
      "measurements": [],
